WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.209 --> 00:00:02.001
Dear diary,

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.545
Everything in my life is changing.

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:05.880
My best friend Justin is moving to Alabama.

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:08.591
And my mom's got a boyfriend. It's weird.

00:00:08.591 --> 00:00:09.968
Can I have a donut?

00:00:09.968 --> 00:00:11.636
How would you like a protein smoothie?

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:12.470
Did you stay overnight?

00:00:13.388 --> 00:00:14.848
Okay, fine! You can have a donut!

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:16.141
Yes!

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:18.393
Can you just give him a chance?

00:00:18.393 --> 00:00:19.352
He's a sports car.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:20.103
A what?

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:21.813
A phase.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.398
Just saying.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.443
Hey, dad. I was just thinking of you.

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:27.527
I'm sure mom's told you.

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:28.486
I'm moving back.

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:31.197
I'm so glad you're coming home.

00:00:34.743 --> 00:00:36.035
I love that you're doing your art.

00:00:36.035 --> 00:00:37.746
But you know, you also need people.

00:00:38.830 --> 00:00:40.290
Friends are good to have.

00:00:40.290 --> 00:00:41.583
Hi,

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:42.751
I'm Brandi with an "I"

00:00:42.751 --> 00:00:44.043
are you starting middle school

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:44.919
at Park Ridge tomorrow?

00:00:47.172 --> 00:00:48.381
Did you make any new friends?

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:49.424
I think so.

00:00:49.424 --> 00:00:51.843
You wanna sit together... for lunch?

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:53.887
Yeah!

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:57.182
Good news of the day,

00:00:57.182 --> 00:00:58.183
dad comes home.

00:00:58.183 --> 00:01:00.685
Dinner is served!

00:01:00.685 --> 00:01:01.686
And Stanley knows my name.

00:01:01.686 --> 00:01:02.395
Hey, Stanley.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:03.813
Oh, hey, Amber!

00:01:03.813 --> 00:01:05.523
He'd be even luckier if he got to know you.

00:01:05.523 --> 00:01:06.441
Ouch!

00:01:07.150 --> 00:01:07.901
That was loud.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.153
I wish they'd stop moving that pillar!

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:10.904
Don't look back!

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:11.905
Oh, right. Okay.

00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:14.491
I don't want to feel guilty

00:01:14.491 --> 00:01:15.283
for being happy.

00:01:15.283 --> 00:01:17.869
How do you decide whose happiness is most important?

00:01:17.869 --> 00:01:18.578
Phil.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:19.245
Max.

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:19.871
Sarah.

00:01:19.871 --> 00:01:20.330
Honey.

00:01:20.330 --> 00:01:21.122
-Yeah?
-Yes?

00:01:21.122 --> 00:01:23.291
This is like a movie and I'm an extra in it.

00:01:23.291 --> 00:01:24.375
This is serious.

00:01:24.375 --> 00:01:25.293
I know.

00:01:25.293 --> 00:01:28.004
The movie is gonna be a drama. Duh.

00:01:30.006 --> 00:01:31.633
Mom, I'm sad.

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:33.760
Happy times won't last forever.

00:01:35.428 --> 00:01:37.597
But neither will sad times.

00:01:37.597 --> 00:01:41.601
We'll never, ever love anyone as much as we love you.

00:01:43.019 --> 00:01:45.271
So, can I get a dog?

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.773
I see what you just did there.

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:56.908
♪♪

